## Web viewer libraries

These JavaScript and CSS files are embedded in the binary and served by
`rdf-compare serve`.

| Library | Version | License | Files |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [Tabulator](https://tabulator.info) | 6.3.1 | MIT | `assets/vendor/tabulator/` |
| [Leaflet](https://leafletjs.com) | 1.9.4 | BSD-2-Clause | `assets/vendor/leaflet/` |
| [wellknown](https://github.com/mapbox/wellknown) | 0.5.0 | WTFPL | `assets/vendor/wellknown/` |

The map in the web viewer loads tiles from [OpenStreetMap](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)
at run time. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
[Open Database License](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/).

